  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 760026,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 18th Gate: A Synopsis\n\nDescend into the perilous depths of the Himalayas with *18th Gate* for Nintendo 3DS! This thrilling, first-person survival horror adventure casts you as a member of a covert British expedition, tasked with infiltrating a remote, ancient monastery rumored to hold a powerful artifact. What begins as a scientific mission quickly spirals into a desperate fight for survival against a terrifying, unseen force.\n\nExplore claustrophobic, intricately designed environments, utilizing the 3D capabilities to enhance the sense of dread and immersion. Solve challenging puzzles rooted in Tibetan mythology and unravel the dark secrets of the monastery's past.  Manage your sanity and resources carefully – darkness, isolation, and the unsettling presence of the unknown will chip away at your mental fortitude. \n\n*18th Gate* features a unique sanity mechanic, influencing your perception and the unfolding narrative.  Experience a chilling atmosphere, unsettling sound design, and a gripping storyline that will keep you on the edge of your seat.  Can you uncover the truth behind the 18th Gate and escape with your life?"
    },
